				UmbralNadirJavelin.DisplayName: 冥蚀矛
				UmbralNadirShadowSoul.DisplayName: 暗影魂针
				UmbralNadirVoidShard.DisplayName: 虚空碎渊
				UmbralNadirFinalExplosion.DisplayName: 冥蚀终爆
				UmbralNadirSpinHoldout.DisplayName: 回旋斩迹
